我且要住在耶和华的殿中，直到永远。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}